[{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0056","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0187","title":"Linux Kernel Netfilter ip_conntrack 连接跟踪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.4.20 版本的 Netfilter 连接跟踪模块（CONFIG_IP_NF_CONNTRACK 或 ip_conntrack）存在拒绝服务漏洞。由于内核链表实现与连接跟踪状态机之间的不一致，Netfilter 无法正确识别处于 UNCONFIRMED 状态的连接，导致这些连接使用过长的超时时间而无法被及时清理。远程攻击者可通过持续发送大量未确认的网络连接请求，耗尽系统连接跟踪资源，造成目标系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响启用连接跟踪功能的 Linux 2.4.20 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0187"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-08-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.21 或更高版本（2.4.21 已修复此问题）；如无法升级内核，应用 Netfilter Core Team 提供的补丁（修改 ip_conntrack.h 和 ip_conntrack_core.c 中连接跟踪状态判断逻辑，引入 IPS_CONFIRMED 标志位替代链表指针判空）。临时缓解措施：卸载 ip_conntrack 模块（rmmod ip_conntrack），或在 iptables 规则中避免使用 conntrack 模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105986028426824&w=2","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A260","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0187.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0187","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0187","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0187.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0187","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0187.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0187","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2003/CVE-2003-0187.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0187.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0074","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0254","title":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.47 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache 2.0.47 之前版本在 IPv6 主机上运行时，其 FTP 代理模块在尝试创建 IPv6 套接字失败后会陷入无限循环，导致 CPU 资源被耗尽，造成拒绝服务。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过构造特定 FTP 请求触发该漏洞，影响运行 Apache 2.0.47 之前版本且启用 IPv6 及 FTP 代理功能的服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0254"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-08-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:50Z","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 2.0.47 或更高版本（官方修复版本）。由于 Apache 2.0.x 已停止维护，强烈建议升级至 2.4.x 最新稳定版。如无法立即升级，可在配置中禁用 mod_proxy_ftp 模块（注释掉 LoadModule proxy_ftp_module 行），或通过防火墙规则阻止外部对 FTP 代理端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105776593602600&w=2","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:075","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-240.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae0dc7b07f63bb8fc%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r2cb985de917e7da0848c440535f65a247754db8b2154a10089e4247b%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5001ecf3d6b2bdd0b732e527654248abb264f08390045d30709a92f6%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache