VE-2003-0254.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0254.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0073","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0253","title":"Apache HTTP Server 2 prefork MPM 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache 2.0.47 之前版本的 prefork MPM（多进程处理模块）在处理 accept 系统调用返回的特定错误时存在缺陷，未能正确进行异常处理。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 Apache 服务器发送大量精心构造的连接请求，触发 accept 错误处理逻辑中的异常路径，导致服务器进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache 2.0 系列至 2.0.47 之前的所有版本，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0253"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-08-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:50Z","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 2.0.47 或更高版本（官方已停止维护 2.0 系列，建议升级至当前受支持的 2.4.x 版本）。如无法升级，可在配置中限制 Listen 指令仅绑定必要端口，并通过防火墙限制对 Apache 端口的访问来源以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105776593602600&w=2","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:075","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-240.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae0dc7b07f63bb8fc%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r2cb985de917e7da0848c440535f65a247754db8b2154a10089e4247b%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5001ecf3d6b2bdd0b732e527654248abb264f08390045d30709a92f6%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r7035b7c9091c4b665a3b7205364775410646f12125d48e74e395f2ce%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E