serv NIS Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ypserv NIS 服务器 2.7 之前版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送一个不响应的 TCP 客户端请求，导致 ypserv 进程阻塞，从而造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响运行 ypserv NIS 服务的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络触发，属于低复杂度攻击。建议升级至 ypserv 2.7 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0251"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-07-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:50Z","remediation":"将 ypserv NIS 服务器升级至 2.7 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003-173 或 RHSA-2003-201 提供的更新包；Mandriva 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:072 更新；TurboLinux 用户安装 TLSA-2003-43 更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上限制对 ypserv 端口（TCP/UDP 111 及 32770-32890）的访问，仅允许受信任的 NIS 客户端连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/21112","http://securitytracker.com/id?1016517","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert%2F55600&zone_32=category%3Asecurity","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:072","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-173.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-201.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/440454/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/8031","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-43.txt","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2006/2873","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A667","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0251.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0251","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0251.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0251.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2003/CVE-2003-0251.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0251.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2003/CVE-2003-0251","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0251.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0251.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-02xx/CVE-2003-0251.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0086","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0386","title":"OpenSSH OpenSSH 主机访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 3.6.1 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞。当系统通过数字 IP 地址限制主机访问且禁用 VerifyReverseMapping 选项时，远程攻击者可通过构造包含目标数字 IP 地址的反向 DNS 主机名，从该系统连接目标主机，从而绕过 \"from=\" 和 \"user@host\" 地址限制策略，实现未经授权的访问。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响 OpenSSH 版本的 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0386"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:02:06Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.7 或更高版本（2003-09-16 发布），该版本已修复此漏洞并将 VerifyReverseMapping 替换为 UseDNS 选项。如无法立即升级，建议启用 VerifyReverseMapping 选项，并避免使用纯数字 IP 地址作为主机访问限制条件，改用主机名方式进行限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/mhonarc/security-announce/msg00038.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/21129","http://secunia.com/advisories/21262","http://secunia.com/advisories/21724","http://secunia.com/advisories/22196","http://secunia.com/advisories/23680","http://support.avaya.com/elmodocs2/security/ASA-2006-174.htm","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/978316","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2006-0298.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2006-0698.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/324016/2003-06-03/2003-06-09/0","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7831","http://www.vmware.com/support/vi3/doc/esx-3069097-patch.html","http://www.vmware.com/support/vi3/doc/esx-9986131-patch.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A9894","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2003/CVE-2003-0386.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0386.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0386","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0386.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0386.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0386.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2003/CVE-2003-0386.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2003/CVE-2003-0386.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0386.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0386.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0084","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0367","title":"GNU gzip znew 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"gzip 软件包中的 znew 工具在处理压缩文件时未对临时文件的创建进行充分的安全检查，存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上创建恶意的符号链接指向系统任意文件，当 root 用户或其他用户执行 znew 命令时，程序会以当前用户权限覆盖被链接的目标文件，导致任意文件写入。该漏洞影响多个 Linux 发行版，攻击者需具有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0367"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:02:04Z","remediation":"升级 gzip 到 ≥1.4.0 版本，该版本修复了 znew 工具中临时文件的 symlink 攻击漏洞。如无法立即升级，可使用 `gzip -S` 选项指定安全临时文件前缀，或在/tmp 中使用具有安全权限的临时目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-308","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:068","http://www.openpkg.org/security/OpenPKG-SA-2003.031-gzip.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7872","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-38.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0367.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0367","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0367.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0367.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2003/CVE-2003-0367.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0367.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2003/CVE-2003-0367","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0367.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-03xx/CVE-2003-0367.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0367.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0085","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0370","title":"KDE Konqueror Embedded X.509证书CN字段未验证中间人攻击漏洞","description":"KDE 2.2.2 及更早版本中的 Konqueror Embedded 组件未对 X.509 数字证书的通用名称（CN）字段进行有效性验证，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过中间人攻击方式伪造合法网站的 SSL/TLS 证书。当用户访问使用 HTTPS 加密的网站时，攻击者可拦截并篡改通信内容，窃取敏感数据或重定向至恶意站点，且用户无法察觉证书异常。该漏洞影响 KDE 2.2.2 及之前所有版本中的 Konqueror 嵌入式浏览器组件，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。KDE 开发团队已在后续版本中修复此证书验证缺陷，建议用户升级至 KDE 2.2.3 或更高版本以消除安全隐患。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0370"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:02:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 KDE 至 3.0.5a 或 3.1.2 及以上版本（KDE 3.0 起不受影响）；无法升级 KDE 2.2.2 的用户可应用官方补丁 post-2.2.2-kdelibs-kssl-2.diff 和 post-2.2.2-kdelibs-kio-2.diff（下载地址 ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/security_patches）。Konqueror/Embedded 用户应升级至 2003 年 5 月 16 日之后快照版本。Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2003:192/RHSA-2003:193 更新，Debian 用户安装 DSA-361 更新，TurboLinux 用户安装 TLSA-2003:36 更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.grok.org.uk/pipermail/full-disclosure/2003-May/004983.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-361","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20030602-1.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-192.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-193.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/320707","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7520","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-36.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0370.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0370","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0370.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0370","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0370","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/17667b5495f12f52eeccac23e3922067b089ebc4/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0370","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0370.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5606c11566e9461a0d44f0944086969cb6810ef1/2003/CVE-2003-0370.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0370.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0370.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0083","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0364","title":"Linux Linux Kernel 2.4 TCP/IP 分片重组哈希表碰撞拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux Kernel 2.4 的 TCP/IP 分片重组处理模块中的哈希表存在漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 IP 分片数据包，引发大量哈希表碰撞，导致目标系统 CPU 资源被大量消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.4 系列版本，攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可远程触发，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0364"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:02:04Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.21 及以上版本，该版本修复了 IP 碎片重组哈希表碰撞导致的 CPU 耗尽问题。如无法升级内核，可在边界防火墙上限制分片数据包进入，或使用 iptables 规则丢弃异常分片：iptables -A FORWARD -f -m limit --limit 100/s --limit-burst 200 -j DROP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-311","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-312","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-332","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-336","http://www.debian.org/security/2004/dsa-442","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-187.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-195.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-198.html","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-41.txt","https: